{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39947","headline":"寺中偶题 · 徐夤","name":"寺中偶题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"听话金仙眉相毫，每来皆得解尘劳。\n鹤栖云路看方贵，僧倚松门见始高。\n名利罢烧心内火，雪霜偏垢鬓边毛。\n银蟾未出金乌在，更上层楼眺海涛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}